{"id":"9ac2726b1083a9db","group":"57","path":"57/57-thm-subformula-completeness.md","title":"Subformula Property","display":"thm-subformula — Subformula Property","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Mathematical Logic (Ebbinghaus, Flum, Thomas)","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-thm-subformula-completeness","aliases":["57-thm-subformula-completeness"],"display":"thm-subformula — Subformula Property","depends_on":["[[57-df-subformula]]","[[57-df-sc-derivable]]","[[57-df-fin-deriv-tree]]","[[57-df-herbrand-expansion]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic (Ebbinghaus, Flum, Thomas)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-thm-subformula-completeness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-thm-subformula-completeness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-subformula — Subformula Property"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c503c7cd3e5d57d1\" href=\"?note=c503c7cd3e5d57d1\" title=\"57-df-subformula\">57-df-subformula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"177be28d1dd7c11d\" href=\"?note=177be28d1dd7c11d\" title=\"57-df-sc-derivable\">57-df-sc-derivable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d0789749a0d83f0d\" href=\"?note=d0789749a0d83f0d\" title=\"57-df-fin-deriv-tree\">57-df-fin-deriv-tree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"341dd891eed2b080\" href=\"?note=341dd891eed2b080\" title=\"57-df-herbrand-expansion\">57-df-herbrand-expansion</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"Subformula-Property\">Subformula Property</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,\\Delta\">\\(\\Gamma,\\Delta\\)</span> 为有限的无量词且无等号公式集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EqFree}\">\\(\\mathrm{EqFree}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"341dd891eed2b080\" href=\"?note=341dd891eed2b080\" title=\"57-df-herbrand-expansion\">57-df-herbrand-expansion</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DerTrees}_{SC}\">\\(\\mathrm{DerTrees}_{SC}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{root}\">\\(\\mathrm{root}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d0789749a0d83f0d\" href=\"?note=d0789749a0d83f0d\" title=\"57-df-fin-deriv-tree\">57-df-fin-deriv-tree</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sf}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sf}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"c503c7cd3e5d57d1\" href=\"?note=c503c7cd3e5d57d1\" title=\"57-df-subformula\">57-df-subformula</a>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q=\\Gamma_q\\Rightarrow\\Delta_q\">\\(q=\\Gamma_q\\Rightarrow\\Delta_q\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{forms}(q)=\\Gamma_q\\cup\\Delta_q\">\\(\\mathrm{forms}(q)=\\Gamma_q\\cup\\Delta_q\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NodeForms}\">\\(\\mathrm{NodeForms}\\)</span> 按有限树递归。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{forms}(\\Gamma_q\\Rightarrow\\Delta_q)\\coloneqq\\Gamma_q\\cup\\Delta_q.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{forms}(\\Gamma_q\\Rightarrow\\Delta_q)\\coloneqq\\Gamma_q\\cup\\Delta_q.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NodeForms}(\\langle q,\\langle d_1,\\ldots,d_k\\rangle\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{forms}(q)\\cup\\bigcup_{i=1}^k\\mathrm{NodeForms}(d_i).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{NodeForms}(\\langle q,\\langle d_1,\\ldots,d_k\\rangle\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{forms}(q)\\cup\\bigcup_{i=1}^k\\mathrm{NodeForms}(d_i).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{SC}\\Delta\\to\\exists d\\in\\mathrm{DerTrees}_{SC}\\;\\left[\\mathrm{root}(d)=(\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\Delta)\\land\\mathrm{NodeForms}(d)\\subseteq\\bigcup_{\\varphi\\in\\Gamma\\cup\\Delta}\\mathrm{Sf}(\\varphi)\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{SC}\\Delta\\to\\exists d\\in\\mathrm{DerTrees}_{SC}\\;\\left[\\mathrm{root}(d)=(\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\Delta)\\land\\mathrm{NodeForms}(d)\\subseteq\\bigcup_{\\varphi\\in\\Gamma\\cup\\Delta}\\mathrm{Sf}(\\varphi)\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>不能以任意公式集 Π（甚至空集）充当证明。这里明确给出实际推导树；字面子公式结论限定于无量词无等号片段，避免把量词实例或等号替换实例误作原式的字面子公式。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Subformula-Property","text":"Subformula Property","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-subformula","status":"resolved","id":"c503c7cd3e5d57d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-subformula]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-sc-derivable","status":"resolved","id":"177be28d1dd7c11d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-sc-derivable]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-fin-deriv-tree","status":"resolved","id":"d0789749a0d83f0d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-fin-deriv-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-herbrand-expansion","status":"resolved","id":"341dd891eed2b080","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-herbrand-expansion]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-herbrand-expansion","status":"resolved","id":"341dd891eed